[2026-02-02T19:45:05.697+0000] {docker.py:429} INFO - 2026-02-02 19:45:05 [scrapy.core.scraper] DEBUG: Scraped from <200 https://www.bresciatoday.it/eventi/mostre/Brescia-mostra-victoria-mater-capitolium.html>
{'category': ['Mostre'],
